{"sha": "ebb2829bd3b4044cd8c509c49dd46b7c8ffd8efc4df8cfddbd3f46842e352def", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:mechanical-energy} 章 --- 机械能及其守恒}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:1}", "(a) $v = \\qty{6.94}{m/s}$：", "$E_k = \\tfrac12 \\times 90 \\times 6.94^2 \\approx \\qty{2.2e3}{J}$。", "(b) $v = \\qty{36.1}{m/s}$：", "$E_k = \\tfrac12 \\times 1200 \\times 36.1^2 \\approx \\qty{7.8e5}{J}$。", "(c) $\\times 4$；$\\times 9$ --- 平方关系。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:2}", "$\\Delta E_p = 75 \\times 9.81 \\times 850 \\approx \\qty{6.3e5}{J}$。不对：", "参考平面的选取使两个值同时平移相同的量。不对：只有高度", "差参与计算。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:3}", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 20} = \\qty{19.8}{m/s} \\approx", "\\qty{71}{km/h}$。$mgh = \\tfrac12 mv^2$，质量消去。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:4}", "$W = \\Delta E_k = 0 - \\tfrac12 \\times 1200 \\times 25^2 =", "\\qty{-3.75e5}{J}$；$F = \\num{3.75e5}/50 = \\qty{7.5e3}{N}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:5}", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 0.080} \\approx \\qty{1.3}{m/s}$；它会", "回升至 \\qty{8.0}{cm}（机械能守恒）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:6}", "$\\num{1.5e9}/\\num{2.6e3} \\approx \\num{5.9e5}$：约六十", "万颗子弹。$h = 88.9^2/(2 \\times 9.81) \\approx \\qty{4.0e2}{m}$", "--- 其自身速度足以将列车抬升 $400$ 米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:7}", "速率相同，$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 3.0} \\approx \\qty{7.7}{m/s}$", "（只与下降高度有关）。陡坡滑道用时更短：它能更快达到较高速率，", "且路程更短。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:8}", "$h = v^2/2g = 144/19.62 \\approx \\qty{7.3}{m}$。在 \\qty{4.0}{m} 处：", "$v = \\sqrt{144 - 2 \\times 9.81 \\times 4.0} \\approx \\qty{8.1}{m/s}$ ---", "两个方向上结果相同：$E_m$ 只取决于高度，与运动方向无关。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:9}", "$v = \\sqrt{23^2 + 2 \\times 9.81 \\times 35} = \\sqrt{1216} \\approx", "\\qty{35}{m/s}$。实际值更小：空气阻力耗散了部分", "$E_m$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:10}", "$\\Delta E_m = \\tfrac12 \\times 45 \\times 8.0^2 - 45 \\times 9.81 \\times", "6.0 = 1440 - 2649 \\approx \\qty{-1.2e3}{J}$；", "$f = 1209/15 \\approx \\qty{81}{N}$。转化为热量，进入滑雪板与", "雪面之中。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:11}", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 0.15} \\approx \\qty{1.7}{m/s}$；它会", "再次升至 \\qty{15}{cm}。钉子改变了路径（圆周更小），而", "不改变能量：高度与速率均不受影响。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:12}", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 2.5} = \\qty{7.0}{m/s}$。上升高度与", "$E_m$ 成正比，因此每次往返 $\\times 0.9$：$2.25$、$2.03$、$1.82$、", "$1.64$、$1.48$、$1.33$、$1.20$、$1.08$、$0.97$ --- 在第", "$9$ 次往返时首次低于 \\qty{1.0}{m}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:13}", "初始 $E_m = \\tfrac12 m \\times 15^2 + m \\times 9.81 \\times 45$ 相同，无论角度如何，", "因此落地速率为", "$v = \\sqrt{225 + 2 \\times 9.81 \\times 45} = \\sqrt{1108} \\approx", "\\qty{33}{m/s}$。角度决定落地速度的\\emph{方向}、飞行时间与", "射程 --- 不决定落地速率。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:14}", "$\\tfrac12 mv^2 = mgh - f\\ell = 80 \\times 9.81 \\times 120 - 65 \\times", "800 = \\num{94176} - \\num{52000} = \\qty{4.22e4}{J}$，于是", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times \\num{42176}/80} \\approx \\qty{32}{m/s}$", "（\\qty{117}{km/h}）。耗散比例：$52000/94176 \\approx 55\\%$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:mechanical-energy:15}", "$m = \\qty{2.0e9}{kg}$：", "$E_p = \\num{2.0e9} \\times 9.81 \\times 300 \\approx \\qty{5.9e12}{J}", "= \\num{5.9e12}/\\num{3.6e6} \\approx \\qty{1.6e6}{kW.h}$。回收的能量：", "$0.85 \\times \\num{1.64e6} \\approx \\qty{1.4e6}{kW.h}$ --- 约可供", "$\\num{1.4e5}$ 户家庭用电一天。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g11:mechanical-energy:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $v_{\\text{top}} = \\sqrt{gR} = \\sqrt{9.81 \\times 8.0}", "\\approx \\qty{8.9}{m/s}$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $E_m = mg\\,(2R) + \\tfrac12 m gR = \\num{3.14e5} +", "\\num{7.8e4} \\approx \\qty{3.92e5}{J}$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $mgH_{\\min} = E_m$ 得 $H_{\\min} = \\qty{20}{m}$；", "代数上 $H_{\\min} = 2R + \\frac{gR}{2g} = \\frac{5R}{2}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $v_{\\text{top}} = \\sqrt{2g(H - 2R)} =", "\\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 8.0} \\approx \\qty{12.5}{m/s}$；", "$v_{\\text{top}}^2/(gR) = 2.0$ --- 是最小值的两倍。", ""]}